  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">FMGII：德國包</h1>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_84037abc-f141-4fc8-aa5b-452c1d94886e.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 此為 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fels-machine-guns-ii\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fel's Machine Guns II</strong></a> 的附加模組，旨在加入二戰德國槍<strong>械</strong>，同時保持主模組的精簡。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">目前包含 MG42 與 MG34 及其對應的合成配方（未來將添加更多槍械）。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">前置需求：<strong>Fel's Machine Guns II</strong>（主模組及其相依模組）。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_8ead54bc-ed6d-4ece-b6f7-9e0718f51b19.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/blhvNbqsUTE\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>",
